{"skill":{"slug":"ai-agent-helper","displayName":"AI Agent Helper"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771511716748,"changelog":"Initial release - Prompt engineering & agent setup","changelogSource":"user","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":861,"sha256":"bdd1ab2b593e2f5b117c250fef6e2f76dbd811af66c35b1b8c3167b94e833f72","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1629,"sha256":"c88df6e0a51c9b462fc86a0fd44cbd2f31a408fd39c9a08196f5c850c2c7ab73","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789073836211,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b95e7fccf4ffa0625e9cad2289e580f11e1ba1cd76c7b0c0dec716f3105e5452","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b95e7fccf4ffa0625e9cad2289e580f11e1ba1cd76c7b0c0dec716f3105e5452","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: ai-agent-helper\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe skill bundle contains only metadata (`_meta.json`) and descriptive documentation (`SKILL.md`). The `SKILL.md` file outlines the purpose of the AI Agent Helper skill, its features, usage scenarios, and technical approaches, including a benign example of a good prompt structure. There is no executable code, no instructions for the AI agent that could lead to prompt injection, data exfiltration, malicious execution, or any other harmful behavior. All content aligns with the stated purpose of assisting with AI agent setup and optimization.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779165453927},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":17,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789073836211},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a small Markdown-only skill for helping design AI-agent prompts and workflows, with no code execution, data access, persistence, or hidden behavior found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"No filesystem, network, shell, credential, account, or external-service access is requested; the described behavior is proportionate to an advisory prompt-design skill.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains only artifact/SKILL.md; metadata is empty and no executable installer, dependency, network retrieval, or setup script is present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The usage examples are broad and the skill is written in a specific Chinese/Cantonese style without explicit locale handling, but the instructions do not override system rules, request secrets, or direct unsafe behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistent memory writes, background workers, scheduled tasks, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, or cross-session modifications are present.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is prompt engineering, task decomposition, agent loop design, tool selection, and structured output guidance; the artifact content matches that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you want agent/prompt-design help in the language style shown. Review outputs for fit before applying them to sensitive agents, because the skill gives general agent-design patterns rather than strict safety boundaries.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The language-style concern is a usability/localization issue for a Chinese/Cantonese skill, not evidence of hidden or unsafe capability.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: The broad activation examples are under-scoped quality guidance, but the artifact is Markdown-only and does not grant authority or direct high-impact actions.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789073836211}}}}}